{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5894a6bd2e72134464a20d20dafaee6410b950b3426ff426db8e4a37576356f4", "ja": "美希からの突然の愛の告白に驚いたプロデュ\nーサーは思わず話を逸らし、美希を落ち込ま\nせてしまうが、それは美希が新曲に向き合う\nための行動だった。互いに向き合い直す事で\n美希は元気を取り戻し、公演を成功させる。", "zh": "面对美希突如其来的深情告白，惊讶的制作\n人下意识岔开了话题，导致美希情绪低落。\n但这其实是美希为了认真面对新歌所做出的\n举动。在双方重新面对彼此后，美希重新振\n作起来，并成功举办了公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1000_007ior", "source_sha256": "b2827f5bde25101d88e94a3bc7840fb93a7ecf67b71147afbc56bac772860b39", "ja": "……サイッテーねっ！", "zh": "……差劲透了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1001_p", "source_sha256": "811a987ea1a654c7015cafcefa76d634685451dbcd05b9c2f73e8a619d8314e4", "ja": "そ、そうか？　そう……かな……。\nとっさに、どうすればいいかわからなくて……。", "zh": "是、是吗？　是……这样吗……\n我一时不知道该怎么办……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "56fb6e4a1a34719cb5691a4b86cc305ae1c3f206edb3dc1b4971c142e4a0ad30", "ja": "{$P$}さん、モテモテですね♪\n女の子を泣かせちゃダメですよ、モテデューサーさん！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，很受欢迎呢♪\n不能惹女孩子哭哦，万人迷制作人先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "069ae901d9c5147afeff1c1a61e4c6a65866a1bd591421cc848d29e0f78b833c", "ja": "でも、あれはアセっても仕方ないって。\nオレたちも超アセったもん。な、莉緒？", "zh": "不过，那种事着急也没用啊。我们也慌得不得了。对吧，莉绪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "49b368325b1e2bfa37b691ddb4c8acafb0b3add05d0db9dfda222a0b95280ff8", "ja": "そ、そうね。\n美希ちゃんらしいとは思ったけど……？", "zh": "是、是啊。\n虽然我觉得这确实很有美希的风格……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1005_null", "source_sha256": "0713fab87bf69d586231430ad728fd0998648ff28507279a32ae8a3a53652f0a", "ja": "―『星井美希　突然の告白事件』発生直後―", "zh": "―“星井美希 突然告白事件”发生之后不久―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "fe28c76305b114b0fa507778da2418e08b70c187dd5ac360f25ac73563066889", "ja": "……大好き！\nミキと、付き合ってくださいっ！", "zh": "……最喜欢你了！\n请和美希交往吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
