{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "9011f11e923b1bb2e1e9b7a68455b80493ae6ad6541c7c23fe730e33dcfc3c79", "ja": "えええええええええええええええ～！？", "zh": "欸欸欸欸欸欸欸欸欸欸欸欸欸欸～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1009_p", "source_sha256": "fe83f07971a153da15079185106bdd948dce8b0d59ea080e18c4d9bdd2891611", "ja": "み……、美希？　急にそんな、どうして……。\nあ、もしかして、失恋を体験するために？", "zh": "美……、美希？这么突然，为什么……\n啊，难道说，是为了体验失恋吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1010_p", "source_sha256": "60da6b4c0cd820e3439dc2d4ca5d478ba5590f26fe5249ab5efb17dde0533b3e", "ja": "いや、前向きなのは嬉しいけど、こんなフリをしても、\n失恋を学んだ事には……ならないんじゃないかな？", "zh": "虽然你这么积极我很高兴，但就算假装成这样，也不能算是体验过失恋吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "970b45d0c14c3e086e68e8c5f37472e32c5b8e92785a35e859869924fbfb8dd6", "ja": "え？　フリって……。", "zh": "诶？你说的“演”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "fe257e13409e4df1f316f885c7a6e490ca6f26fdb71d224bd2b3b253337c2242", "ja": "フリ？　あ、もしかして演技ってこと！？\nマジかよ、全然わかんなかったよ！", "zh": "“假装”？啊，难道是说演技！？\n真的假的，我完全没看出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "754d198e31f3e05eecb13676f7da61ccbdc4f7217bcfa69d56ba27fa45b8e2ab", "ja": "演技って、でも……。\nそうなの、美希ちゃん？", "zh": "说是演技，可是……  \n是这样吗，美希？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "48d0d77c786ffc07ea69fa8f4eedc747cc339899a593557aa43ccf7c584f885f", "ja": "あ……。うん、そうだね。\nそう、だけど……。答えてくれないんだ……。", "zh": "啊……嗯，是啊。\n对，不过……就是不肯回答我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "70028ed1d939899e88a6a3da3090c0a94a68421fde8d10fe890e4a5962806175", "ja": "……。むーっ、もういいの！\nミキ、今日は帰るねっ。バイバイ！", "zh": "……哼，算了啦！\n美希今天要回去了。拜拜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1016_p", "source_sha256": "bf8810fa3bf5bcc5d765d0d8b90840e3d42b1e3dca0b5688375dadaed2c0b492", "ja": "あ、美希！？　バイバイって、ちょっと……！", "zh": "啊，美希！？说什么再见啊，等一下……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "628ffe79c9134ca576a4bdf273d6f3873ed19945b1eb17ea7b076e04cefbbcb6", "ja": "……ってことだったんでしょ？\nホント、サイテーだわっ。", "zh": "……也就是说，是这么回事吧？\n真是的，太差劲了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "16454647e20a707cc585afc95d1c7bc5a9bd1e868d73ea924aea44935974a7a0", "ja": "とりあえず、ちゃんと美希ちゃんに合わせてあげた方が\nよかったのかもね。……ほら、新曲のためだしっ。", "zh": "总之，或许还是好好配合美希比较好吧。……毕竟，是为了新歌嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
