{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "bab89c642db47a0c09283e3e76fe2715faa08d108a77ff0b95bba17ebc1891b5", "ja": "美希の告白、すげー本物っぽかったよな。\n……あ、本物がどんなのかは、よくわかんないけど。", "zh": "美希的告白，感觉特别像真的一样。\n……啊，不过我也不太清楚真的告白是什么样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "0476b6895f07701a976f1d13783da43acfea4cf842e988a89c937facb2179ea2", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、昴ちゃん。わからなくてもわかること、\n意外とたくさんあるんじゃないかな♪", "zh": "没关系的，小昴。就算不明白也能明白的事，\n其实也是有很多的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "0f00fb43122bebfc73fde9d787a204b5a8cd769e8b33150d9e9f198c0969908b", "ja": "麗花……。なんかカッコイイけど、\nオレ、わかんないことはわかんないよ～！", "zh": "丽花……感觉是挺帅的，可我不明白的事情就是不明白嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1023_007ior", "source_sha256": "112cc4d0ff4ed83d1c90089716341e4017eb9f618a9d3dfd1a4a6070af9239ac", "ja": "……とにかく！　女の子の気持ちを受け止めないで、\n適当にごまかすなんて不誠実だわ。フセイジツ！", "zh": "……总之！不去理解女孩子的心情，反而随便敷衍过去，实在太不诚实了。不诚实！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1024_p", "source_sha256": "fe0dda6b39f46a45ba396cf0370506009db14fae1a330705ea559cf8ed768938", "ja": "そ、そうなのかな……。\nやっぱり、ハッキリ断るべきだったかな？", "zh": "是、是这样吗……\n果然，还是应该明确拒绝才对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1025_007ior", "source_sha256": "9620488231c1b87faf573d1830a25c9cfee1443a115d5f9a449d7f1d14495523", "ja": "なんてヒドイこというのよ！\nカワイソウとか思わないわけ！？", "zh": "你怎么能说这么过分的话！\n你难道不会觉得人家很可怜吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1026_p", "source_sha256": "699f170a44f11f8a0e862a53cf0ba2587ead3d1fac78400997f0e1ee86067efe", "ja": "えっ。それじゃまさか……\n付き合えばよかったのか？", "zh": "诶……难道说……\n和她交往就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1027_007ior", "source_sha256": "b9e1e0233cd864884df43f0922c09ef0824de089857c3adc2f1517777b313bda", "ja": "いいわけないでしょ、この変態、ド変態！\n変態・オブ・ザ・イヤー！　立場をわきまえなさい！", "zh": "怎么可能好啊，你这个变态，超级大变态！\n年度变态！给我认清自己的立场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1028_p", "source_sha256": "1387b2d35e5e3b47fb7f3263b7278c57b678554995adc72dc97b28dda394dde6", "ja": "じゃあ、どうすればよかったんだ！？", "zh": "那我到底该怎么办才好啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1029_007ior", "source_sha256": "747c2cc2bc8e4d3822cb73aa497b0f81a78036ca71d930446d3e0618a00e551c", "ja": "それを考えるのがアンタの仕事でしょ！？\n誰が告白されたと思ってるのよ……バカ。", "zh": "想办法解决这个问题，不就是你的工作吗！？\n你以为被告白的人是谁啊……笨蛋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
