{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1034_048rei", "source_sha256": "22dab31dbad755a871abe9f9a87c0269a8e41f152852686e37cd135b0269bdf2", "ja": "美希ちゃん、お疲れ様！\nちょうど私達も休憩中だよ♪", "zh": "美希，辛苦啦！\n我们也正好在休息哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1035_003mik", "source_sha256": "ab47e40d7b25ace20d346b35890721ba764693d355838641bc56c6544962ea53", "ja": "じゃあ、タイミングばっちりってカンジだね。\nもう再開する時間？", "zh": "那时机正合适呢。\n已经到重新开始的时间了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1036_p", "source_sha256": "8bfd4261fe78db066b738aaa77c187fcc2d7dd7107ab29594aa9542db5f046de", "ja": "ええと、特に決めてなかったけど……\nそうだな。美希の準備ができたら再開しようか？", "zh": "呃，之前没特别决定过……  \n这样吧，等美希准备好了就重新开始，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1037_003mik", "source_sha256": "8f9aa502a4b8057336fe9dadd52faec283246dd91c64483eb356eb92c4c038c6", "ja": "……。つーん。", "zh": "……哼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1039_046rio", "source_sha256": "97d867e40e37e971b28096175a9300fb3c3a5302ae33a199bc02cf97237b9624", "ja": "え、ええっと～。じゃあ、\n美希ちゃんの準備ができたら再開ね！", "zh": "呃、呃呃～。那么，等美希准备好后再继续吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1040_003mik", "source_sha256": "4ff1cc26d0888e1eb935d2a037789cb48eef21c5204f0e7761f30c6e96b57d4c", "ja": "大丈夫だよ。ミキはもう準備バッチリってカンジ！\nみんな、よろしくお願いしますなの！", "zh": "没问题的。美希感觉已经完全准备好啦！\n大家，请多指教啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1041_p", "source_sha256": "68662d705ef2569121bbad7d31e4f72fb205282c822dacd92ae52e82735483a3", "ja": "よ、よし。じゃあ、まずは美希を交えた立ち位置確認\nから始めようか。全員、自分の番号を確認してくれ！", "zh": "好、好的。那么，先来美希也参与进来的站位确认\n开始吧。大家，都确认一下自己的号码！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1042_003mik", "source_sha256": "d787f00f6a973f2304a56f4e8da1b1c66a565a44dcb939d020e517c0e71278d8", "ja": "……っ。つーん！", "zh": "……唔。哼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1043_p", "source_sha256": "58cbbc3da0ccaba00f90355a0ef1ac2d591ddaebe287d0f8942fbbcf1931c09b", "ja": "（ダメか……）", "zh": "（不行吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1044_047sub", "source_sha256": "f2afc0995042a42bbf67a28b07802849654eae7674d6f792eee5d68c528f7c2f", "ja": "あ、オレ3番！　美希はセンターだから、8……\nじゃなくて0番な。へへっ、頼むぜセンター！", "zh": "啊，我是第3号！美希是C位，所以是第8号……不对，是第0号。嘿嘿，C位，拜托你啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1045_003mik", "source_sha256": "edca8980e6452b23a69a63e16fcf4fb8e19036d6262f3bae541d2c360eeda561", "ja": "うんっ。ありがと、昴くん☆", "zh": "嗯！谢谢你，昴君☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1046_007ior", "source_sha256": "3063468e53c3a53943b3f4e1b3985b4be303bc891d96aacbc97b83613bb9c34d", "ja": "ほら見なさい。アンタのせいで、\nおかしなことになっちゃってるじゃない。", "zh": "你看嘛。都怪你，已经变得奇怪了不是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1047_p", "source_sha256": "6ec16aabaf5551146060421eee257f7f209de213691e2112f77faa006a53c232", "ja": "そうだな……このままだとレッスンに支障が……。\nよし、俺はいったん席を外すよ。みんな、しっかりな！", "zh": "是啊……这样下去会影响训练的……\n好，我先离开一下。大家，加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1048_003mik", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1049_se", "source_sha256": "915debc9212fd0686aae26480bf67b09f22a04b209f5676018725c6fb9d85206", "ja": "バタン……", "zh": "砰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1050_p", "source_sha256": "0a5016f1a2781d3bf342a8b2478ca167f044b433ac54ce9a11ac0f8e59104088", "ja": "（とはいったものの……。\nこのままには、しておけないよな……）", "zh": "（话虽如此……也不能就这样放着不管啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1051_048rei", "source_sha256": "776a61fba8b89ee9260dd36c1dff417a5cf61b8e777238d691b762e618410b66", "ja": "{$P$}さん、いっちゃったね。\n元気にレッスンできますか、美希ちゃん？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，走掉了呢。\n还能打起精神练习吗，美希？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1052_003mik", "source_sha256": "8e1abfc1ce0c92b46b0e19c7026971991212dd7111e18043b53c21c5b4080598", "ja": "麗花……。", "zh": "丽花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1053_047sub", "source_sha256": "7a61cda044d15f9b01c7cf19d4e8eab8c5799bb9f6f30fde5c23790b42c59bda", "ja": "美希～、まだ{$P$}と\nケンカしてんのか？", "zh": "美希——你还在和{$P$}吵架吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1054_003mik", "source_sha256": "161bf4d6c95a2081bc41f960a375ae83f1e2f2d7cbaf7fb4045e724ee1cbbc73", "ja": "ケンカじゃないの。\nミキはちょっと……モヤモヤしてるだけ。", "zh": "不是在吵架。\n美希只是有点……心里闷闷的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1055_046rio", "source_sha256": "64c75d4f33258caa9dd1ec4b8ac722996b7c150b11186e5129b67931d2dbfa7c", "ja": "それって、{$P$}くんが……\n告白の返事、くれなかったから……よね？", "zh": "是因为……{$P$}先生……没有给你告白的答复……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1056_047sub", "source_sha256": "c79494d9f4c7054399e47bca79a623332a6d3e4e1b5b50407c00f77684413e19", "ja": "でもさ、{$P$}もアセったみたいだし\n仕方ないって。オレもすげーアセったし！", "zh": "不过嘛，{$P$}好像也慌了，所以没办法啦。我也慌得不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1057_003mik", "source_sha256": "5f45943c20736cd67dc4c2c5d6167bf3545efd79fbdc42d55d58c71714db40a3", "ja": "……そうだよね。ミキも、ちょっと焦っちゃったの。\n今度の新曲、ちゃんと歌いたいって思ったから……。", "zh": "……是啊。美希也有点着急了。\n因为我想好好唱好这次的新歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1058_048rei", "source_sha256": "3cc124b2930dd428b4fd47845a4be1c33e3b2f7bd7e5b4ab5ddf3b86d2b545a7", "ja": "それできっと、触れてみたくなったのかな？\n{$P$}さんの心に。", "zh": "所以，是因为那样，才会想要试着触碰吧？\n触碰{$P$}先生的内心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1059_003mik", "source_sha256": "88770aead3e679d08aed715ab98c78d3b1c7a5796affb50e472fd92dac568b43", "ja": "うん……。でも、避けられちゃった。\n今日も、おいてかれちゃったし。", "zh": "嗯……可是，被躲开了。\n今天也把我一个人丢下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1061_003mik", "source_sha256": "962e3f8bf6e5c081ead6f77b4dd01919465988a73bef27ea3ec106e581497fd6", "ja": "もしかして、{$P$}はミキのこと、\n本気で見てくれて……ないのかな……。", "zh": "难道，{$P$}根本就没有认真看待美希……吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1062_003mik", "source_sha256": "f34786443177fc0d132743e3327a77a8fa782630244e9b507aff0cff3459c83e", "ja": "ミキ、もしかして本当に失恋しちゃったのかな……？\nぐす……っ。ねえ莉緒、違うよね……？", "zh": "美希难道真的失恋了……？\n呜……喂，莉绪，不是这样的吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1063_046rio", "source_sha256": "1d6a2fc7258078856752c7d6d60c7cc97d54eae560ba9239a588809fbdb23bd0", "ja": "え、え……？　美希ちゃん……。\nもちろん違うわよ、失恋なんて……絶対違うっ！", "zh": "诶、诶……？美希……。\n当然不是啦，什么失恋……绝对不是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1064_047sub", "source_sha256": "a3021887f165f6f227f3f6c374c92b3ddf227cb9dbac744d55e1d6b6b6ccb7b4", "ja": "ていうか、どうしたんだよ美希？\nホントも何も、あれは演技って……。あれ？", "zh": "话说回来，美希，你这是怎么了？\n什么真的假的，那只是演戏……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1065_007ior", "source_sha256": "b1727b248ba5395b279564438140b1ed26c074a163eaf1037fe7ee1aebef2cdc", "ja": "あ～あ！　美希ったら、もう失恋しそうな女の子の\n演技までモノにしちゃったのね。さすがだわ～。", "zh": "哎呀呀！美希，你连那种马上就要失恋的女孩子都演得这么像了啊。真不愧是你～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1066_003mik", "source_sha256": "129611b148d2af4fd01208b3199b1fbfb27adae923cd42bbd8550c02d4565371", "ja": "伊織……。", "zh": "伊织……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1067_007ior", "source_sha256": "107a6ac23cd74e0dce3b0cab47b293446dadb08b4fb8d250782f212f8fd6aaa2", "ja": "せっかくだから、そのままあきらめ切れない女の子を\n演じ切ってみたら？　今すぐ追い掛けるとか！", "zh": "难得有这个机会，不如就把那个始终无法彻底放弃的女孩子演到底？比如现在就追上去之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1068_048rei", "source_sha256": "25493b4f8271e3f4b047b7eef013a1fce1031c3d583ff4845d9c0969e6110915", "ja": "わぁ、まさにドラマのクライマックスだね！\nいいと思いまーす♪", "zh": "哇，简直就像电视剧的高潮情节呢！\n我觉得很棒～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1069_046rio", "source_sha256": "9d3f68eedd2909a82671a2b071661fab054d55aeaa9b5885b19170ba92f48565", "ja": "あ……そういうことだったの！？　やだ私ったら\nつい本気で……んもう、美希ちゃんホント上手～！", "zh": "啊……原来是这么回事！？真是的，我呀，\n一不小心就认真起来了……哎呀，美希你真的好厉害～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1070_047sub", "source_sha256": "fcff2b731b776c8d3be87226580f2f1911b5b80f27fb612cd8c9da52a4f57ed6", "ja": "そっか…ビビった～！　よーし、じゃあオレもっ！\nなあ美希、{$P$}と話して来いって！", "zh": "这样啊……吓我一跳～！好，那我也来！\n喂，美希，你去和{$P$}聊聊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1071_007ior", "source_sha256": "3632a9af1aa913df4f2f012a32cae38145a635ab31f9c8867c7aa25f7497fecd", "ja": "だいたい、アイツが美希を見てないなんて……。\nそんなわけないじゃない。", "zh": "说到底，那家伙怎么可能没在看美希……这种事根本不可能嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1072_003mik", "source_sha256": "bc60017cf16453b20caae0dc161adc478cb2c545ff8453e8ee32f46859cf9820", "ja": "……ホント？　{$P$}はミキのこと、\nちゃんと本気で……見てくれてる？", "zh": "……真的吗？{$P$}你真的有……\n认认真真地注视着美希吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_1073", "source_sha256": "a33967b3fe4d92e08113bb6ad7b15b47c8ffb5fa8f47144c1b5e5c56e5d51720", "ja": "もちろん", "zh": "当然", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2000_p", "source_sha256": "a009024f822a08964a5b718df9fa9151913d83418d70587fccad40e6c9622943", "ja": "もちろんだ、美希！", "zh": "当然啦，美希！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2002_046rio", "source_sha256": "dc5207b937432ba73a3f01a8b3e25e734f4175faec2a24ade74b3b4ae7395cb7", "ja": "（すごーい！　すごいわ{$P$}くん！\nタイミングバッチリじゃない！　なにこれ～！）", "zh": "（好厉害！太厉害了，{$P$}君！时机抓得刚刚好嘛！这是什么啊～！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2003_047sub", "source_sha256": "5d190fe71af6cedef4bdad033e2a27977c05150319ba1bb6a630021eef90ddd4", "ja": "（オレこういうの、なんか百合子に読まされた\nマンガでみた気がする！）", "zh": "（这种情节，我好像在百合子让我读过的漫画里见过！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2004_003mik", "source_sha256": "6b12e64e61a982a69178bd7380f956e12e8c5881ad11aa4dcc5a0ba713f503c9", "ja": "ミキのこと……\nおいてって、なかったんだ……？", "zh": "关于美希……\n你没有把我丢下……吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2005_p", "source_sha256": "372deb09d4133b584e8064b89c0b5bd64783a48d8926c7107c23b63c66d6d307", "ja": "ああ。美希、今回のこと、ちゃんと話そう。\n俺もあらためて、ちゃんと向き合うよ。美希に……。", "zh": "啊。美希，我们好好谈谈这次的事吧。\n我也会重新认真面对……美希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2006_p", "source_sha256": "7855c27943e2417125132add69203e097099d8caf7cb00f43601ea22b488a4c1", "ja": "ただし、今日のレッスンをきちんと終わらせてからな！", "zh": "不过，要先好好完成今天的课程才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2007_003mik", "source_sha256": "10a689a69d936d04873b8ada8fdc3831b8d20595015605be4d9d11e55b4df809", "ja": "うん……、うんっ、わかったの！\nありがとね、{$P$}。", "zh": "嗯……嗯，美希知道了！\n谢谢你哦，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2008_003mik", "source_sha256": "fc444d83f6e453ab440559bf8f44858ae42377a140e376d0ad0f15e736a5f323", "ja": "ミキも、ちゃんと向き合うね。\n{$P$}と……今日のレッスンに！", "zh": "美希也会好好面对的。\n和{$P$}一起……还有今天的课程！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2009_048rei", "source_sha256": "cdddf5ee1994ed7af4f0ac29ca2db516aedd32d8c21979ba7ee3b33c0dbf63de", "ja": "それじゃ今度こそ、レッスン再開ですね！　\nぴゅーんって一瞬で終わらせちゃいましょーう♪", "zh": "那么这次就真的要重新开始训练了呢！\n咻——一下子转眼就结束吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2010_007ior", "source_sha256": "c02edbe2c0a58b67f9945b00eb84fa140a50881a794ab77f405237609ea1fb42", "ja": "ふう。これで大団円ってとこかしら。\nまったくもう……世話が焼けるわねっ！", "zh": "呼……这下总算是大团圆了吧。\n真是的……还得让人操心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2012_p", "source_sha256": "9da548915081fb40fbc47d6e9d89ad4a9600237572c725b6b8a4653013f5cd32", "ja": "……しかし、本当に30分もしないで、ぴゅーんと\nレッスンが終わるとは思わなかったな……。", "zh": "……不过，真没想到连30分钟都不到，训练就嗖的一下结束了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2013_003mik", "source_sha256": "932a6b67cb09e7c96e571225692844c4cc7dc4ea89ef310ff6ee9ef38a46431d", "ja": "当たり前って思うな。だって……\n{$P$}がずっと見ててくれたから。", "zh": "美希觉得这是理所当然的呀。因为……\n{$P$}一直都在看着美希嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2014_003mik", "source_sha256": "b92ec9ff9ab0fcc177f085bc61cac97678b57eeaec4aede9b9bdd235a1131aa2", "ja": "本当は、今日の最初から最後まで、\nず～っとだったけど……。あはっ♪", "zh": "其实，从今天一开始到最后，\n一直～～都在看着我……啊哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2015_p", "source_sha256": "72b2449fbf40975df4ea4601acc1a5716a17e00f25591f1ca7aef7652854c2e2", "ja": "そうなんだ。部屋を出ていったものの、\nやっぱり気になって……というか、反省したんだ。", "zh": "原来是这样。虽然离开了房间，\n但果然还是很在意……不，应该说，我反省了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2016_p", "source_sha256": "82d26f4291a014d0bc60bb12b00e9b9d2f3d3f79ab2fed754027454d00e9b76d", "ja": "昨日はごめんな、美希。\n美希は本気だったのに、ついはぐらかしてしまって。", "zh": "昨天对不起，美希。\n你是认真的，我却敷衍了你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2017_003mik", "source_sha256": "c24a5b2311c706119e4599d1089660edb0479ccd4ffb8388b66228d7c1323fe0", "ja": "ううん、ごめんなさいはミキの方なの……。\n本気なのは、{$P$}だよね。", "zh": "不是的，该说对不起的是美希才对……\n真正认真的人，是{$P$}对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2018_p", "source_sha256": "bf205a0fe1086948217359368d108d2041f4c25b8abe82113c859cd11cff9bf9", "ja": "……あれ、そうだっけ？", "zh": "……咦，是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2019_003mik", "source_sha256": "cb4aff69043521f208b3f3b951762138dd31efc0aa31dd54c136f9c3a77d3941", "ja": "うん。……ミキね、{$P$}がくれた\n今度の曲が、すごく好き。大好きなの。", "zh": "嗯。……美希呢，非常喜欢\n{$P$}这次给美希的新歌。最喜欢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2020_003mik", "source_sha256": "03359e9792bb97126413cc2b20b384bf53f8ff25dd54954c854cc831ab186ae5", "ja": "絶対カッコいいし、思いっきり歌えそうだし。\nあと……聞いたときに、すぐわかったから。", "zh": "肯定很帅气，而且感觉能尽情地唱出来。还有……因为我听到的时候，一下子就明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2021_003mik", "source_sha256": "a37a2bf41a363523e46b1641a8a691c672d946cd27f035145c3710e2435ef3e0", "ja": "この曲は、ミキのことばっかり考えて、ミキのために、\n本気で作ってくれたんだって……。それで！", "zh": "这首歌是只想着美希，真心为美希创作出来的……所以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2022_p", "source_sha256": "e492db669aa111802aa04a750f0821a88959acb51805dce5c9008f5373afa61a", "ja": "そうか……。\nよかったよ、美希に気に入ってもらえて。", "zh": "这样啊……\n美希能喜欢，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2023_003mik", "source_sha256": "ce7cd7a8d27883107ed7100756d284f83a1c2b8a98b83970b4fc33d3fb2dcf2d", "ja": "うん。だから、ちゃんと歌いたいって思って。\nそこそこなんかじゃなくて、本気の、本物のミキで。", "zh": "嗯。所以，美希想要好好唱出来。\n不是随随便便敷衍，而是拿出动真格的、真正的美希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2024_003mik", "source_sha256": "8db99f17270279449797cbab5d6374ab9f1af4d7a73f2cf2e4b8ec9c11127e20", "ja": "この曲で、今までで一番すごいミキを見せたい。\nこの曲なら見せられるって思ったの！", "zh": "我想用这首歌展现出有史以来最厉害的美希。\n因为我觉得，用这首歌一定能做到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2025_003mik", "source_sha256": "b5fc7ad1cba5eb6cdfe9097e01eee30632f5294dc5018f54f71e8430d02204f8", "ja": "それで……本物の恋の気持ちに、ちゃんと触れてみよう\nって思って。ミキの大事な……本物の気持ちに。", "zh": "所以……我想好好触碰一下真正恋爱的心情。\n去触碰美希珍视的……真正的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2026_p", "source_sha256": "6924805f73d8f95ae6c519aa51b0e76e8bcc66941958afc87614bf027cf820ce", "ja": "美希……。", "zh": "美希……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2027_003mik", "source_sha256": "f66f0e43f06b711a6e3c5885d8a4129e87d0bc9e0590fd92df96c16ac58fdab0", "ja": "でも、たくさん困らせちゃったよね。\n本当にごめんなさいでした、なのっ！", "zh": "可是，还是给你添了很多麻烦吧。\n真的非常对不起啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2028_p", "source_sha256": "f8661773e3ddfe015c69bc195e97aaf504b10c4d8c706b240ba202749d1adc73", "ja": "そうか、それでああいうことに……。\nありがとう。美希の気持ち、確かに受け取ったよ。", "zh": "这样啊，所以才会变成那样……\n谢谢你。美希的心意，我确实收到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2029_p", "source_sha256": "cd4e5f1ac2c68d8863860858ea77509851c263186d60855d75b45160408691b1", "ja": "どれだけ返せるかはわからないけど……\nでも一つだけ、約束する。", "zh": "虽然不知道我能回报多少……\n但有一件事，我可以向你保证。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2030_p", "source_sha256": "5e700f64df01d1f1760fc7366e70603684a48226795fd86c748d533dfb28953d", "ja": "俺はこれからも、美希を最高に輝かせてみせる。\n美希の一番近くで、一番すごい美希になれるように！", "zh": "我今后也会让美希绽放出最耀眼的光芒。\n为了让美希成为最棒的美希，我会一直陪在她最近的地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2031_003mik", "source_sha256": "38b9de5eded9edffd6058f7717300b44a6715ff296f8f4d4e6385a39b9c8883e", "ja": "……うん！　ミキもがんばるね。\n今までで一番の、最高のミキになるっ！", "zh": "……嗯！美希也会加油的。\n美希会成为有史以来最棒、最耀眼的美希！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2032_p", "source_sha256": "3592561eee6506139ae6cb9111bbbf61ef295fee59256e689a649f535899f727", "ja": "ああ。今度の公演では、お客さん全員ひとり残らず、\n美希の虜になってもらおうな！", "zh": "啊。这次的公演，要让所有客人一个不剩地都成为美希的俘虏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2033_003mik", "source_sha256": "2a4e02077fbd7026c0ac85b42b75b800bf2a70e4e1e2c1d29100cde09cb1970c", "ja": "そのつもりなの！\nでも、誰に一番トリコになって欲しいかは～。", "zh": "我就是这么打算的！不过，我最想让谁为我着迷呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_071_2034_003mik", "source_sha256": "fa397e704c47be27cc6602cb0f422f6adeaeaa6ea293866dbc240b4fa070551e", "ja": "もちろん、わかってるよね、ハニー？　……あはっ☆", "zh": "当然知道的吧，亲爱的？……啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
